{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/8d1d4732eb2ba31643fc8189f67c5956.poster.avif?t=1756533888\" width=616 height=313 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/8d1d4732eb2ba31643fc8189f67c5956.webm?t=1756533888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NEO-INDUSTRIAL URBAN COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NEVER SAFE IN DELAWARE features fast-paced, kinetic action against a variety of inner-city scum and criminals, with a massive arsenal for each character. Swap on the fly between 3 unique characters, each with their own abilities and weapons, as you fight to make your grand escape.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/d3f14acab183071cc3d66c2a8bec43e1.poster.avif?t=1756533888\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/d3f14acab183071cc3d66c2a8bec43e1.webm?t=1756533888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/d3f14acab183071cc3d66c2a8bec43e1.mp4?t=1756533888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YIPPEE-KI-YAY, MOTHERFUCKER\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 20+ weapon arsenal, beat 'em up-style melee combat, and tons of unique finishing moves keep NEVER SAFE IN DELAWARE\u2019s combat varied and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/f4009aef285a4504482d82f3e823a69e.poster.avif?t=1756533888\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/f4009aef285a4504482d82f3e823a69e.webm?t=1756533888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/f4009aef285a4504482d82f3e823a69e.mp4?t=1756533888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE ALTERNATIVE MILLENNIUM\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a city under the blade: rife with rackets, violence, organized crime, and thieves-in-law, three lowlives find themselves wrapped in a life-threatening conspiracy, forced to fight their way through America\u2019s heart of darkness...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/c5db5a93b97b223c55af72a5913174a5.poster.avif?t=1756533888\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/c5db5a93b97b223c55af72a5913174a5.webm?t=1756533888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/c5db5a93b97b223c55af72a5913174a5.mp4?t=1756533888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3847550?t=1756533888","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/7968012dabcb0e4f1fa8988106405f7d33af4f5b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756533888","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/505895d193f3ff0a8ddf5026c2d9578a4b77ebe0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756533888","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/505895d193f3ff0a8ddf5026c2d9578a4b77ebe0/c